DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:Iceland: Monthly levy (tryggingagjald) payment\, due date
DESCRIPTION:The payment period is the calendar month. The due date (gjaldda
 gi) is the 1st of each month for the previous month's pay\; the final date
  (eindagi) is 14 days later.\nApplies to: Employers paying tryggingagjald\
 nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.skatturinn
 .is/atvinnurekstur/skattar-og-gjold/tryggingagjald/\nDetails: https://www.
 intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#iceland\n\nFor information only\, not
  legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source
 \; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 12 October 
 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#iceland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:is-tryggingagjald-benefits-july@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270702
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=7;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:Iceland: Annual levy on pay and benefits outside withholding\, due 
 date
DESCRIPTION:The due date for levy on pay\, payments and benefits outside wi
 thholding is 1 July each year and the final date is one month later\; bene
 fits of the previous year are paid in one sum.\nApplies to: Payers of pay 
 or benefits outside withholding\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n
 \nSource: https://www.skatturinn.is/atvinnurekstur/skattar-og-gjold/tryggi
 ngagjald/\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#icela
 nd\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the rec
 urring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. 
 Sources last checked 12 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#iceland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
